---
/**
 * Theme representative observation shell.
 * Cards are filled client-side into #recommendations.
 */
---
<section aria-labelledby="representative-title">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div>
      <span class="pill pill-red">🔴 趋势确认</span>
      <h2 id="representative-title">主题代表观察</h2>
    </div>
    <p>同主题最多保留一只，用于比较强度与风险</p>
  </div>
  <div class="top-panel card">
    <div class="rec-list" id="recommendations"></div>
  </div>
</section>
